<title>BRAZIL: Brazil gov't to auction 200,090 bags coffee May 7.</title>
<headline>Brazil gov't to auction 200,090 bags coffee May 7.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's government is to auction 200,090 60-kg bags of coffee from its stocks at a regular monthly auction May 7, according to a statement from Banco do Brasil which is to hold the electronic sale.</p>
<p>Members of the domestic roasting and soluble coffee industry as well as exporters can participate in the auction.</p>
<p>There will, however, be no sales of lower quality coffee open just to the soluble industry as in previous sales. </p>
<p>Details of the coffees are as follows. Quantity is in bags.</p>
